# IntraCore: параметры HAL блока из базы STM32CubeMX (db/mcu/IP/*_Modes.xml).
# Порождено tools/hal_import — руками не править. Формат: src/Docs/Description/HalCatalogFormat.md
[Ip]
Name=DDR_CTRL_PHY
Version=ddr_v2_0

[Parameters]
# имя|подпись|группа|единица|мин|макс|описание
DDR_Start_Address|This is the base address for DDR subsystem in the specific MPU packages considered|||||
RD-PRE|RD-PRE|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
tRPRE|READ Preamble (tRPRE)|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||Programmable READ preamble tRPRE, can be set to either 1tCK or 2tCK via the MR3 register.
tWPRE|WRITE Preamble (tWPRE)|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||Programmable WRITE preamble tWPRE, can either be set to 1tCK or 2 tCK via the MR3 register.
FGRM|Fine Granularity Refresh Mode (FGRM)|REFRESH TIMINGS||||Controls REFRESH cycle time and average refresh interval for the DDR4 SDRAM via the MR3, leave default 1x.
VREF (%)|VREFDQ Training Value|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|%|||VREFDQ Training Value: Fifty settings provided 0.65% of granularity steps sizes for both Range 1 and Range 2 of VREFDQ; Range 1 with 74.3% is set by default. (the optimal setting according to Impedance is determined during PHY Initialization).
LPASR|Low-power auto self refresh (LPASR)|SELF REFRESH TIMINGS||||SELF REFRESH operation over different temperature ranges can use this feature to optimize the IDD6 current for a given temperature range as specified in the MR2 register.
ODI|Output Driver Impedance Control (ODI)|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||The output driver impedance of the DDR4 SDRAM device is selected via MR1 register.
RTT_NOM|DDR4 nominal termination (RTT_NOM)|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||DDR4 nominal termination programmed via MR1 register.
ASR|ASR|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
SRT|SRT|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
Ron|Ron|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||
RTT_WR|DDR4 termination during Write (RTT_WR)|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||DDR4 termination during Write programmed via MR2 register.
CAS lat|CAS lat|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||
RTT_PARK|DDR4 parked termination (RTT_PARK)|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||DDR4 parked termination programmed via MR5 register.
WR-RTP|Write recovery / READ to Precharge (WR-RTP)|DISPLAY VALUE|clock|||Write recovery / READ to Precharge programmed in MR0 (this parameter is determined according to frequency and tWR / tRTP).
WR|WR|DISPLAY VALUE|clock|||
WCL|WCL|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||Write command latency applicable only when Write CRC and DM are enabled, leave default (4).
memclk|memclk|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|MHz|300|800|This Parameter can be changed from the clock tree.
version|version|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||Platform selection: 2: STM32MP25 3: STM32MP21 4: STM32MP23
package|package|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
Speed_Bin|Speed_Bin|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
BL|Burst Length (BL)|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|bits|||Burst Length (BL8/BC4/BC4 or 8 on the fly) leave default (BL8).
device_width|device_width|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|bits|||
ranks|Number of ranks|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||Number of ranks (dual rank is improbable with 2 8Gbit with half width interface).
Addressing|Row,Bank, Column Address Mapping configuration|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||Row,Bank, Column Address Mapping configuration according to options supported: - RBC is Row,Bg0,B1,B0,Col (default) - BRC is Bg0,B1,B0,Row,Col
RDBI|Data Bus Inversion for READ (RDBI)|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||Data Bus Inversion for READ can be enabled to reduce power and to improve SI at the expense of additonal latency and timings degradation, it is not activated by default.
RPST|RPST|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||DDR4 supports a fixed postamble it is 1/2tCK.
WR-PST|WR-PST|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||
DBI-RD|DBI-RD|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
DBI-WR|DBI-WR|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
PU-CAL|PU-CAL|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
PDDS|PDDS|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||
CA ODT|CA ODT|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||
DQ ODT|DQ ODT|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||
SoC ODT|SoC ODT|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||
ATx Impedance|ATx Impedance|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||
ODT Impedance|ODT Impedance|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||
Tx Impedance|Tx Impedance|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|ohm|||
phyvref|phyvref|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|%|||% of VDDq
training_sequence|training_sequence|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|hexa|||
WR-PRE|WR-PRE|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||DDR4 supports a fixed postamble it is 1/2tCK.
RL|RL|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||
WL|WL|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||
Per_bank_ref|Per_bank_ref|SYSTEM PARAMETERS||||
