CWL|CAS Write Latency (CWL)|JEDEC CORE TIMINGS|clock|||CAS Write latency for timing and DDR4 MR2 registers, calculated according to frequency.
nWR|nWR|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||JEDEC timing vs frequency.
nRTP|nRTP|SYSTEM PARAMETERS|clock|||JEDEC timing vs frequency.
