NUMACTIVEDBYTEDFI1|NUMACTIVEDBYTEDFI1|USER INPUT BASIC||||Enter number of active dbytes to be controlled by dfi1.
NUMANIB|NUMANIB|USER INPUT BASIC||||Enter number of ANIBs physically instantiated.
