NUMPSTATES|NUMPSTATES|USER INPUT BASIC||||Number of p-states used.
FREQUENCY_0|FREQUENCY_0|USER INPUT BASIC||||Memclk Frequency for each PState.
PLLBYPASS_0|PLLBYPASS_0|USER INPUT BASIC||||Indicates if PLL should be in Bypass mode.
DFIFREQRATIO_0|DFIFREQRATIO_0|USER INPUT BASIC||||Selected Dfi Frequency ratio.
DFI1EXISTS|DFI1EXISTS|USER INPUT BASIC||||Indicates whether they PHY configuration has Dfi1 channel.
