LP4POSTAMBLEEXT_0|LP4POSTAMBLEEXT_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Extend write postamble in LPDDR4.
D4RXPREAMBLELENGTH_0|D4RXPREAMBLELENGTH_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Length of read preamble in DDR4 mode.
D4TXPREAMBLELENGTH_0|D4TXPREAMBLELENGTH_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Length of write preamble in DDR4 mode.
EXTCALRESVAL|EXTCALRESVAL|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||External Impedance calibration pull-down resistor value select.
IS2TTIMING_0|IS2TTIMING_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Set to 1 to use 2T timing for address/command, otherwise 1T timing will be used.
ODTIMPEDANCE_0|ODTIMPEDANCE_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Enter desired ODT impedance in ohm.
TXIMPEDANCE_0|TXIMPEDANCE_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Tx Drive Impedance for DQ/DQS in ohm.
ATXIMPEDANCE|ATXIMPEDANCE|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Tx Drive Impedance for AC in ohm.
