MEMALERTPUIMP|MEMALERTPUIMP|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Specify MemAlert Pull-up Termination Impedance.
MEMALERTVREFLEVEL|MEMALERTVREFLEVEL|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Specify the Vref level for BP_ALERT(MemAlert) Receiver.
MEMALERTSYNCBYPASS|MEMALERTSYNCBYPASS|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||When set, this bit bypasses the DfiClk synchronizer on dfi_alert_n.
DISDYNADRTRI_0|DISDYNADRTRI_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Disable Dynamic Per-MEMCLK Address Tristate feature.
PHYMSTRTRAININTERVAL_0|PHYMSTRTRAININTERVAL_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Specifies the how frequent dfi_phymstr_req is issued by PHY.
PHYMSTRMAXREQTOACK_0|PHYMSTRMAXREQTOACK_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Max time from dfi_phymstr_req asserted to dfi_phymstr_ack asserted.
WDQSEXT|WDQSEXT|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Enable Write DQS Extension feature of PHY.
CALINTERVAL|CALINTERVAL|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Specifies the interval between successive calibrations, in mS.
CALONCE|CALONCE|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||This setting changes the behaviour of CalRun register.
