LP4DBIWR_0|LP4DBIWR_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||LPDDR4 Dram DBI-Write Enable.
LP4NWR_0|LP4NWR_0|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||LPDDR4 Write-Recovery for Auto- Pre-charge commands.
LP4LOWPOWERDRV|LP4LOWPOWERDRV|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Configure output Driver in Low power mode..
DRAMBYTESWAP|DRAMBYTESWAP|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||DRAM Oscillator count source mapping for skip_training.
RXENBACKOFF|RXENBACKOFF|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Determines the Placement of PHY Read Gate signal.
TRAINSEQUENCECTRL|TRAINSEQUENCECTRL|USER INPUT ADVANCED||||Firmware Training Sequence Control.
